flowchart TB
  O[Machine operator]
  subgraph Fleet[Adopted operator target - own non-repository identity]
    F[One fleet chat - relay first - native subscription session]
    A[Model-free scoped read and message adapter]
    R[Own record - exact operator answers and thread references]
    L[Own logs partition and model-free fleet viewer]
    F --> A
    F --> R
    A --> L
  end
  subgraph Rewt[rewt identity - Herdr Brain]
    C[Existing rewt coordinator - T2 only within recorded delegation]
    RI[Owner import and export adapter]
    RS[Canonical project supervisor]
    RR[Own record - lanes - reviews - Git identity]
    RP[Owner summaries first - scoped log views later]
    RC[Project chat - supervisor - logs slots retained]
    RI -->|quiet addressed question| RS
    RS --> RR
    RR -->|allowlisted owner export| RP
    RS -->|scoped reply| RI
    RC -.-> RS
  end
  subgraph Bastian[bastian identity - BCH Cloak]
    BI[Owner import and export adapter]
    BS[Canonical project supervisor]
    BR[Own record - lanes - reviews - GitHub identity]
    BP[Owner summaries first - scoped log views later]
    BC[Project chat - supervisor - logs slots retained]
    BI -->|quiet addressed question| BS
    BS --> BR
    BR -->|allowlisted owner export| BP
    BS -->|scoped reply| BI
    BC -.-> BS
  end
  O -->|question or exact scoped answer| F
  A -->|authorized envelope export| RI
  A -->|authorized envelope export| BI
  RI -->|reply export - operator adapter imports| A
  BI -->|reply export - operator adapter imports| A
  RP -->|authorized summary export - log reads require proven enforcement and grant| A
  BP -->|authorized summary export - log reads require proven enforcement and grant| A
  F -.->|bounded request via rewt import| C
  C -.->|rewt decision evidence| RI
  C -.->|cross-identity decision export via owner adapters| BI
  W[Current chats preserved - separate operator workspace is the default]
  W -.-> F
  W -.-> RC
  W -.-> BC
  N[No fleet writes to project files - no transcript access - no refusal forwarding - management needs later delegation]
  A --- N
